<title>SWEDEN: Volvo sales by division for 9 mo 1996.</title>
<headline>Volvo sales by division for 9 mo 1996.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle manufacturer AB Volvo posts sales for the nine months ending September 30, 1996 compared with the corresponding period a year earlier.</p>
<p>(Millions of crowns)</p>
<p>  Volvo Car				59,832  vs  63,148</p>
<p>  Volvo Truck			    32,707  vs  37,957</p>
<p>  Volvo Bus				 5,911  vs   5,458</p>
<p>  Volvo Construction Equipment	9,631  vs   3,013</p>
<p>  Volvo Penta			     2,890  vs   2,980</p>
<p>  Volvo Aero				2,862  vs   2,711</p>
<p>  Group eliminations, other CHARGE  2,012  vs   1,037  CHARGE</p>
<p>  Total vehicle sales		 111,821  vs 114,230</p>
<p>  Total Volvo group		   113,640  vs 129,124</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1045</p>
</text>
